                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I already playtested this game @ Gamescom 2016 and so far the devs made a stunning Smash Bros like brawler.\nWhat I like about this game more than smash bros is the actual 360° aiming and actual physics like slight knockback on shooter and a lot on the target. Furthermore the air balls being shot can be sucked in and shot back with a greater force and give many tactics besides trying to shoot off everyone else.\nThis game is ideal for LAN-Parties and I had a lot of fun with my friends playing it. \nThe low price and quite easy controlls ( I havent touched a controller for 4 years or so) are a definite recommendation!\n\n10/10 would Blow hard again",
